    "Agents can list ports, explain them and find free ports. Stopping is off by default. When allowed, it applies only to dev servers you started; databases, containers, apps and system processes are never stopped by an agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agents can list ports, explain them and find free ports. Stopping is off by default. When allowed, it applies only to dev servers you started; databases, containers, apps and system processes are never stopped by an agent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
