    "Each checked process gets SIGTERM (SIGCONT too if it is suspended) and time to exit. Only dev servers are force-killed (SIGKILL) if they don't exit within 2 s; anything else that keeps running is reported, never force-killed. Likely orphans are unchecked: tick them to include them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each checked process gets SIGTERM (SIGCONT too if it is suspended) and time to exit. Only dev servers are force-killed (SIGKILL) if they don't exit within 2 s; anything else that keeps running is reported, never force-killed. Likely orphans are unchecked: tick them to include them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
